# Kanagawa Wave

# Role assignments and colours are the colorscheme's own extras/fish/kanagawa.fish,
# rewritten as a theme file so `fish_config theme choose` can select it. The second
# token on each line is the 16-colour fallback for terminals without truecolor.

# Syntax Highlighting Colors
fish_color_normal DCD7BA normal
fish_color_command 7AA89F cyan
fish_color_keyword D27E99 brmagenta
fish_color_quote C0A36E yellow
fish_color_redirection DCD7BA normal
fish_color_end FF9E64 brred
fish_color_option 957FB8 magenta
fish_color_error C34043 red
fish_color_param 957FB8 magenta
fish_color_comment 727169 brblack
fish_color_selection --background=2D4F67
fish_color_search_match --background=2D4F67
fish_color_operator 76946A green
fish_color_escape D27E99 brmagenta
fish_color_autosuggestion 727169 brblack

# Completion Pager Colors
fish_pager_color_progress 727169 brblack
fish_pager_color_prefix 7AA89F cyan
fish_pager_color_completion DCD7BA normal
fish_pager_color_description 727169 brblack
fish_pager_color_selected_background --background=2D4F67
